HybridLimit -- an option to control HybridStrategy
**************************************************

Description
===========

This controls behavior when using Strategy=>HybridStrategy.  By increasing the
HybridLimit value (default 15), HybridStrategy will execute SimisStrategy
longer. Infinity will behave exactly like SimisStrategy.

